('crema_calabacin_menta_fodmap',391,'dinner','🥒',
'{"es":"Crema de calabacín y menta (low FODMAP)","en":"Courgette and mint cream soup (low FODMAP)","fr":"Creme de courgette a la menthe (low FODMAP)","it":"Crema di zucchine e menta (low FODMAP)"}',
