'easy','under_20','low',
'{"es":["4 calabacines medianos en dados","700ml caldo de verduras sin cebolla ni ajo","2 cdas aceite de ajo infusionado","Hojas de menta fresca abundantes","Zumo de 1/2 limón","Sal, pimienta blanca","Cebollino verde para decorar","Aceite de oliva para servir"],"en":["4 medium courgettes diced","700ml vegetable stock no onion or garlic","2 tbsp garlic-infused oil","Plenty of fresh mint leaves","Juice of 1/2 lemon","Salt, white pepper","Green chives to garnish","Olive oil to serve"]}',
'{"es":["Sofríe el calabacín en el aceite infusionado 4 min","Añade el caldo y cuece 12 min hasta que el calabacín esté tierno","Añade la menta fresca y el zumo de limón","Tritura hasta obtener una crema suave","Ajusta de sal y pimienta blanca","Sirve con cebollino verde y un hilo de aceite de oliva"],"en":["Sauté courgette in infused oil 4 min","Add stock and cook 12 min until courgette is tender","Add fresh mint and lemon juice","Blend until smooth","Adjust salt and white pepper","Serve with green chives and a drizzle of olive oil"]}'
