'{"es":["2 hamburguesas de ternera (200g c/u, 80% magra)","2 lonchas de cheddar","2 panes de hamburguesa brioche","Lechuga iceberg","1 tomate en rodajas","1/2 cebolla roja en aros","Pepinillos","Para la salsa: 2 cdas mayonesa, 1 cda ketchup, 1 cdta mostaza, pepinillo picado, sal"],"en":["2 beef patties (200g each, 80% lean)","2 cheddar slices","2 brioche burger buns","Iceberg lettuce","1 tomato sliced","1/2 red onion in rings","Gherkins","For sauce: 2 tbsp mayo, 1 tbsp ketchup, 1 tsp mustard, chopped gherkin, salt"]}',
'{"es":["Forma las hamburguesas y haz una pequeña hendidura en el centro (evita que se hinchen)","Cocina en plancha muy caliente 3-4 min por lado para punto medio","Añade el cheddar en el último minuto y tapa para que se funda","Tuesta el pan en la misma plancha","Prepara la salsa mezclando todos los ingredientes","Monta: pan, salsa, lechuga, tomate, hamburguesa con queso, cebolla, pepinillos, pan"],"en":["Shape patties and make a small dent in the centre (prevents puffing)","Cook on very hot griddle 3-4 min per side for medium","Add cheddar in the last minute and cover to melt","Toast bun on the same griddle","Make sauce mixing all ingredients","Build: bun, sauce, lettuce, tomato, cheese burger, onion, gherkins, bun"]}'
),

