'{"es":["9 láminas de lasaña","300g carne picada de ternera","150g panceta en dados","1 cebolla, 1 zanahoria, 1 apio (sofrito)","200ml vino tinto","400g tomate triturado","Para la bechamel: 500ml leche, 40g mantequilla, 40g harina, nuez moscada","80g parmesano rallado","Sal, pimienta"],"en":["9 lasagne sheets","300g beef mince","150g pancetta diced","1 onion, 1 carrot, 1 celery (soffritto)","200ml red wine","400g crushed tomato","For bechamel: 500ml milk, 40g butter, 40g flour, nutmeg","80g grated parmesan","Salt, pepper"]}',
'{"es":["Prepara el ragu: sofríe la panceta, añade el sofrito y cocina 5 min, añade la carne y dórala, vierte el vino y deja evaporar, añade el tomate y cuece 45-60 min a fuego bajo","Prepara la bechamel: derrite mantequilla, añade harina, incorpora la leche caliente poco a poco removiendo hasta espesar, sazona con nuez moscada","Monta: bechamel, láminas, ragu, bechamel, repite; termina con bechamel y parmesano","Hornea a 180°C 30 min hasta gratinar"],"en":["Make ragu: brown pancetta, add soffritto and cook 5 min, add mince and brown, pour wine and evaporate, add tomato and cook 45-60 min on low","Make bechamel: melt butter, add flour, add hot milk gradually stirring until thick, season with nutmeg","Layer: bechamel, sheets, ragu, bechamel, repeat; finish with bechamel and parmesan","Bake at 180°C 30 min until golden"]}'
),

