'{"es":["400g pechuga de pollo en dados","Para la marinada: 150g yogur, 1 cdta garam masala, 1 cdta cúrcuma, 1 cdta comino, 1 cdta pimentón, 1 diente de ajo, jengibre rallado, sal","Para la salsa: 1 cebolla, 3 dientes de ajo, jengibre, tomate triturado, 200ml nata, garam masala, pimentón, comino, cúrcuma, aceite, cilantro"],"en":["400g chicken breast diced","For marinade: 150g yogurt, 1 tsp garam masala, 1 tsp turmeric, 1 tsp cumin, 1 tsp paprika, 1 garlic clove, grated ginger, salt","For sauce: 1 onion, 3 garlic cloves, ginger, crushed tomato, 200ml cream, garam masala, paprika, cumin, turmeric, oil, coriander"]}',
'{"es":["Marina el pollo en el yogur y las especias mínimo 1 hora (mejor toda la noche)","Cocina el pollo marinado en plancha o en horno hasta dorado, reserva","Sofríe la cebolla, el ajo y el jengibre, añade las especias, incorpora el tomate y cuece 10 min","Añade la nata y el pollo, cuece 15 min a fuego bajo","Sirve con cilantro fresco y arroz basmati"],"en":["Marinate chicken in yogurt and spices minimum 1 hour (overnight is better)","Cook marinated chicken on griddle or in oven until golden, set aside","Sauté onion, garlic and ginger, add spices, add tomato and cook 10 min","Add cream and chicken, cook 15 min over low heat","Serve with fresh coriander and basmati rice"]}'
),

